        "overviewText": "Discover why Bali is called the Island of the Gods with this **6 Days 5 Nights Luxury Tour**, featuring a private pool villa stay and an unforgettable Nusa Penida Island experience.\n\nDesigned by India Tour Experiences, this [Bali itinerary](https://indiatour.live/tours/blissful-bali) is the perfect blend of relaxation and adventure — from water sports and temple tours in Kuta to scenic swings and rice terraces in [Ubud](https://indiatour.live/attractions/ubud-village-tour). Add to that a snorkelling trip in [Nusa Penida](https://indiatour.live/attractions/nusa-penida-island)’s crystal-clear waters, and you’ve got the best of Bali packed into six vibrant days.\n\n### **Who Should Book Bali with Private Pool Villa Tour**\n\n- Couples looking for a **romantic yet adventurous [Bali getaway](https://indiatour.live/tours/bali-tour-package)**\n- Families wanting a **luxury experience with leisure time**\n- Travelers seeking a **balance of beaches, culture, and islands**\n- Those who want to explore **Nusa Penida without long transits**\n- Anyone looking for a **value-packed premium [Bali vacation](https://indiatour.live/tours/bali-travel-package)**\n\n### **Highlights of the 6 Days Bali Itinerary**\n\n- **Private Pool Villa Stay in Ubud** – Enjoy your own tropical retreat surrounded by nature\n- **Nusa Penida Island Tour** – Explore stunning viewpoints, hidden beaches & snorkel in turquoise waters\n- **Water Sports at Tanjung Benoa** – Jet Ski, Banana Boat Ride & Parasailing Adventure\n- **Ubud & Kintamani Tour** – Visit Bali’s rice terraces, coffee estates & volcano viewpoints\n- **[Bali Swing Experience](https://indiatour.live/attractions/bali-jungle-swing)** – Get your perfect Instagram shot at the famous swing\n- **Leisure Day in Bali** – Explore beach clubs, markets, or simply relax by your villa pool\n\n### **What Makes This Bali Tour Special**\n\n- Stay in a **luxury private pool villa** for a premium Bali experience\n- **Nusa Penida Island excursion with snorkelling** included\n- **Private AC car** for all sightseeing and transfers\n- Guided by **English-speaking driver cum guide**\n- **Custom balance** of adventure, culture, and relaxation\n- **24x7 India Tour Experiences support** for a seamless trip\n\n**Start Planning Your [Bali Getaway 2026](https://indiatour.live/bali)**",
