        "overviewText": "Discover the true island life with our **Bali Special Package (8 Days / 7 Nights)** that takes you beyond Bali’s beaches — into the serene heart of [Ubud](https://indiatour.live/attractions/ubud-village-tour), the white sands of [Gili Trawangan](https://indiatour.live/attractions/gili-trawangan-island), and the cliffs of Nusa Penida.\n\nThis trip is a perfect blend of culture, adventure, and island relaxation, designed for travelers who want to see *more than just Bali*. From snorkeling in turquoise waters to walking through Ubud’s rice terraces and enjoying pirate dinner cruises, every day offers something new and exciting.\n\nYour stay includes a mix of 4-star resorts and handpicked villas, chosen for their comfort, scenic locations, and Balinese charm. With flights, daily breakfast, private transfers, and guided tours included, all you have to do is sit back and soak in the beauty of Indonesia’s finest islands.\n\nCrafted by India Tour Experiences, this itinerary brings together seamless planning, local expertise, and 24x7 on-ground support — ensuring your island-hopping holiday is effortless from start to finish.\n\nExplore Ubud,Gili & Nusa Penida — all in one [Bali trip](https://indiatour.live/bali)!\n\n### **Who Should Book the Bali Special Package**\n\n- Travelers looking for an **island-hopping adventure** across Bali, [Gili](https://indiatour.live/attractions/gili-trawangan-island) & [Nusa Penida](https://indiatour.live/attractions/nusa-penida-island)\n- **Couples** seeking a romantic yet active getaway with scenic stays\n- **Families** who love a mix of beaches, temples & leisure time\n- **Adventure lovers** keen on water sports, snorkeling & exploring multiple islands\n- **Repeat visitors** to Bali who wish to experience more than [Kuta](https://indiatour.live/attractions/kuta-beach) & Seminyak\n\n### **Experience the Best of Bali, Gili & Nusa Penida**\n\n- **[Handara Gate](https://indiatour.live/attractions/handara-gate) & [Ulun Danu Temple](https://indiatour.live/attractions/ulun-danu-temple)** – Iconic Bali landmarks surrounded by lush greenery\n- **[Tanah Lot Temple](https://indiatour.live/attractions/tanah-lot-temple)** – Witness Bali’s most famous sunset view\n- **Pirate Dinner Cruise** – An evening of food, dance & fun on the sea\n- **West Nusa Penida Tour** – Visit Broken Beach, Angel’s Billabong & Kelingking Cliff\n- **Gili Trawangan Escape** – Crystal-clear waters, snorkeling & tropical beach vibes\n- **Bali Swing & Rice Terrace Visit** – Capture your perfect jungle moment in Ubud\n- **Kintamani Volcano View & [Tegenungan Waterfall](https://indiatour.live/attractions/tegenungan-waterfall)** – Scenic spots that define Bali’s charm\n\n### **What Makes This Bali Tour Package Unique**\n\n- Island-hopping across **Bali, Gili & Nusa Penida** in one trip\n- **Flights included** from Ahmedabad with seamless inter-island transfers\n- Stay in a mix of **handpicked 4-star hotels and villas**\n- **Private sightseeing tours** with English-speaking guides\n- Free time to relax and explore each island at your own pace\n- **24x7 assistance** from India Tour Experiences’ travel experts\n\n**Start Planning Your [Bali Holiday 2026](https://indiatour.live/bali)**",
