      "overviewText": "Experience the spiritual, scenic, and adventurous side of Bali in one beautifully curated trip.\n\nThe **Bali Tour Package with Lempuyang Temple – 7 Days 6 Nights** by **India Tour Experiences** takes you through [Bali’s most iconic highlights](https://indiatour.live/tours/bali-holiday-package) — from ancient temples and crystal-clear beaches to lush rice terraces and thrilling water sports.\n\nThis private tour is perfect for those who want a **[complete Bali experience](https://indiatour.live/tours/bali-travel-package)** — filled with nature, culture, adventure, and relaxation — at a comfortable, budget-friendly price. Choose from **Standard, Premium, or Luxury stays** and customize your experience with our destination experts.\n\n[**Book Bali**](https://indiatour.live/bali) Lempuyang Temple Tour Now!\n\n### **Who Should Book This Bali Package**\n\n- First-time travelers who want to see **Bali’s top attractions** in one trip\n- Culture lovers eager to explore **[Lempuyang Temple](https://indiatour.live/attractions/pura-penataran-agung-lempuyang-temple) & [Tirta Gangga](https://indiatour.live/attractions/tirta-gangga)**\n- Adventure seekers looking for **snorkeling, water sports & jungle swings**\n- Families and couples who prefer a **private, well-organized tour**\n- Budget travelers who want flexibility and curated guidance\n\n### **Best Experiences Included in This Bali Package**\n\n- **[Nusa Penida West Tour](https://indiatour.live/attractions/nusa-penida-island)** – Visit 4 stunning beaches and enjoy snorkeling at 1 point\n- **Water Sports Adventures** – Jet Ski, Banana Boat & other fun activities at Benoa Beach\n- **Temple Trails** – Visit **[Pura Penataran Agung Lempuyang](https://indiatour.live/attractions/pura-penataran-agung-lempuyang-temple)** (the famous “Gates of Heaven”) and **Tirta Gangga Water Palace**\n- **Scenic Countryside Tour** – Kintamani Volcano View, Tegalalang Rice Terraces & [Tegenungan Waterfall](https://indiatour.live/attractions/tegenungan-waterfall)\n- **Iconic Jungle Swing** – Capture Insta-worthy moments at the **Bali Swing by Pioneer**\n- **Leisure Day in Kuta/Seminyak** – Relax, shop, or add optional experiences like spa sessions or beach cafés\n\nPlan Your [**Bali Trip 2026**](https://indiatour.live/tours/discover-bali) Today\n\n### **What Makes This Bali Tour Special**\n\n- Covers **Bali’s top sightseeing highlights** with a blend of culture, nature & adventure\n- Choice of **3 accommodation categories**: Standard, Premium, or Luxury\n- Fully **private tour** with English-speaking guide and AC vehicle\n- Option to **customize the itinerary** with help from India Tour Experiences’ experts\n- 24x7 on-ground support for a seamless and worry-free vacation\n\n**Plan Your [Bali 2026](https://indiatour.live/tours/bali-group-trip) Adventure with India Tour Experiences and let your island story begin!**",
