      "overviewText": "Take your [Bali vacation](https://indiatour.live/bali) to the next level with our **Exotic Bali 7 Days 6 Nights Tour Package**, featuring a one-of-a-kind **stay inside the Mara River Safari Lodge**, where you can watch zebras and giraffes roam right outside your window!\n\nCurated by **India Tour Experiences**, this itinerary blends **wildlife, culture, and comfort** into one incredible trip. From the beaches of [Kuta](https://indiatour.live/attractions/kuta-beach) and the rice terraces of [Ubud](https://indiatour.live/attractions/ubud-village-tour) to thrilling water sports and sunset temples, every day brings something new.\n\nEnjoy **flights from Ahmedabad**, premium stays, a **private pool villa experience**, and a night at [Bali’s iconic Safari Park](https://indiatour.live/attractions/bali-safari-jungle-hopper) — a rare treat for families and adventure lovers alike.\n\n### **Who Should Book Exotic Bali with Mara River Safari**\n\n- Families seeking a **fun and safe wildlife-inclusive getaway**\n- Travelers who want **luxury and adventure** in one Bali trip\n- Couples looking for a **unique stay experience with private villas**\n- Nature lovers eager to see Bali’s wild side\n\n### **Experience the Best of Bali with Mara River Safari**\n\n- **Stay at Mara River Safari Lodge** – Sleep near zebras and rhinos in Bali’s only safari-themed resort\n- **Water Sports at Tanjung Benoa Beach** – Banana Boat rides, Jet Skiing & more adventures\n- **Ubud & [Kintamani](https://indiatour.live/attractions/kintamani) Tour** – Visit the volcano viewpoint, coffee plantations & lush rice terraces\n- **[Tanah Lot Temple](https://indiatour.live/attractions/tanah-lot-temple) & [Bali Swing](https://indiatour.live/attractions/bali-jungle-swing)** – Iconic cultural landmarks and thrilling photo spots\n- **Wildlife Encounters** – Watch animal shows, take a safari tram ride & enjoy the park activities\n- **Day at Leisure** – Unwind by your private pool or discover Bali’s cafés and beach clubs\n\n### **What Makes This Bali Tour Package Unique**\n\n- **Exclusive stay at Mara River Safari Lodge** – a true wildlife experience\n- **Flights included from Ahmedabad** with Malaysia Airlines\n- **Premium pool villas & Jacuzzi upgrades** available\n- Private **AC vehicle & English-speaking guide** throughout\n- **Family-friendly [Bali itinerary](https://indiatour.live/tours/discover-bali)** crafted for comfort and adventure\n- **24x7 India Tour Experiences support** for a seamless holiday\n\n**Start Planning Your [Bali Safari Holiday 2026](https://indiatour.live/tours/amazing-bali)**",
